  "notes": "Time-of-failure was retroactively identified via Past Operability Evaluation (POE) as April 22, 2021, when the ground was first detected on Battery Board 3, though the valve re-opening was not observed until June 5, 2021 during TMOD installation. Duration of inoperability (44 days) spans this full period per the POE. C Outboard MSIV explicitly stated as remaining operable throughout the event, modeled as backup via BACKED_UP_BY rather than a System node since it is itself a component of the same MSIV system, not a distinct system-level backup; kept as Component per schema literal wording. Cause code X (Other) governs category despite narrative emphasizing an electrical grounding failure mechanism."
